## 📖 Surah 109 (Surah Al-Kafirun) se Related Ahadith

**(Roman Urdu – Sahih Bukhari & Sahih Muslim)**

---

## 1. Kuffar ka compromise offer aur Surah ka nazool context

Hazrat Ibn Abbas (RA) se riwayat hai ke Quraysh ke kuch log Nabi ﷺ ke paas aaye aur kaha:

“Aap hamare maboodon ki ek saal ibadat karein aur hum aap ke Rab ki ek saal ibadat karenge.”

Is par Allah ne Surah **Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun** nazil farmai.

**Reference:**
Is exact wording ke sath riwayat **Sahih Bukhari aur Sahih Muslim mein nahi**, balkeh tafsir books mein aata hai.
Lekin Surah ka theme isi baat ko explain karta hai: deen mein compromise nahi.

### Samajh

* Islam haq aur shirk batil hai
* Deen ko mix nahi kiya ja sakta
* Aqeedah par compromise allowed nahi

---

## 2. Nabi ﷺ Fajr Sunnah mein Surah Kafirun parhte thay

Hazrat Abu Hurairah (RA) riwayat karte hain:

“Rasulullah ﷺ ne Fajr ki do sunnat rak’aton mein **Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun** aur **Qul huwallahu ahad** parhi.”

**Reference:**
Sahih Muslim 726

---

### Samajh

* Din ki shuruaat tawheed aur shirk se bara’at ke message se hoti thi
* Surah Kafirun aqeedah ki mazbooti sikhati hai

---

## 3. Tawaf ke baad bhi Surah Kafirun parhna

Hazrat Jabir (RA) riwayat karte hain:

“Nabi ﷺ ne Maqam Ibrahim ke peeche do rakat padhi aur pehli rakat mein **Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun** aur doosri mein **Qul huwallahu ahad** parhi.”

**Reference:**
Sahih Muslim 1218

---

### Samajh

* Tawaf ke baad bhi Nabi ﷺ yeh Surah parhte thay
* Yeh shirk se alag rehne aur pure tawheed ka message hai

---

## 4. Deen par istiqamat

Surah ka last ayah:

**“Lakum deenukum wa liya deen”**
(Tumhare liye tumhara deen, mere liye mera deen)

Yeh sikhata hai:

* Dawah hikmat se karo
* Lekin aqeedah par compromise nahi

---

## 🌿 Surah 109 ka Core Lesson

✔ Tawheed par mazboot rehna
✔ Shirk se door rehna
✔ Deen ko dunya ke liye compromise na karna
✔ Ibadat sirf Allah ke liye

---

## ✍️ Reflection

* Kya main logon ko khush karne ke liye deen compromise karta/karti hoon?
* Kya meri ibadat sirf Allah ke liye hai?

